[8.838729, "o", "\u001b[2m  \"\"\"order-sync: apply the orders from the sales system to the inventory.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Meant to run on a schedule (see README.md)::\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m      python job.py                 # read the CSV export\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m      python job.py --source api    # ask the sales API instead\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.8389, "o", "\u001b[2m  Exit code 0 means the sync finished; anything else means it could not run.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \"\"\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  import argparse\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  import logging\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  ... 466 more lines\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[12.547218, "o", "\u001b[36m\u001b[1m> Bash\u001b[0m .venv/bin/ormaos exceptions r1:e1; cat fetch.py; cat data/cron.log; cat -A data/orders.csv | head -40; wc -l\r\n    data/orders.csv; .venv/bin/python inventory.py --count data/count.csv\r\n"]
[12.665664, "o", "\u001b[2m  r1:e1 validate.SkuFormatError: swallowed\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    raised at   validate.py:24 in check_sku  [r1:c154]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    left calls   check_sku [r1:c154], check_order [r1:c153]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    handled at  job.py:57 in sync_orders  [r1:c106]  and not raised again\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    message     not recorded; args: tuple[1 str]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    same type, same handler: 5 in all: r1:e1 r1:e2 r1:e3 r1:e4 r1:e5\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.665768, "o", "\u001b[2m  next: ormaos tree r1:c106 | ormaos io r1:c106 | ormaos tree r1:c154 | ormaos exceptions r1:e2 | ormaos path r1:e1\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \"\"\"Get the raw orders from the sales system.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Two sources:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  - a CSV export (the default), one order per line;\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.66579, "o", "\u001b[2m  ... 85 more lines\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[17.758, "o", "\u001b[36m\u001b[1m> Bash\u001b[0m .venv/bin/ormaos tree r1:c106 --limit 80; .venv/bin/ormaos io r1; sqlite3 data/inventory.db \"select * from\r\n    applied_orders order by order_id; select * from backorders; select * from stock;\" 2>&1 || .venv/bin/python -c \"\r\n    import sqlite3;c=sqlite3.connect('data/inventory.db')\r\n    for t in ['applied_orders','backorders','stock']:\r\n      print(t); [print(r) for r in c.execute(f'select * from {t}')]\"\r\n"]
[17.938917, "o", "\u001b[2m  inside: r1:c1 <module> > r1:c16 main\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  r1:c106 sync_orders(conn: sqlite3.Connection, orders: list[26 parse.Order]) -> int  job.py:49  8.9ms  io 120  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  [swallowed 5x validate.SkuFormatError: r1:e1]  calls below: 47\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    r1:c107 check_order(order: parse.Order) -> NoneType  validate.py:47  46us  calls below: 3\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m      r1:c108 check_sku(sku: str[8]) -> NoneType  validate.py:22  10us\u001b[0m\r\n"]
